			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">To approve the engagement of PricewaterhouseCoopers LLP, an independent registered public accounting firm, as the Company&#8217;s independent auditor until our 2024&nbsp;annual meeting of shareholders.</p>
