			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Total shareholder return (&#8220;TSR&#8221;) is calculated as the difference between the Company&#8217;s share price at the beginning and the end of the measurement period, divided by the Company&#8217;s share price at the beginning of the measurement period.</p>
